    {L"隐藏 EMS 脚本 HUD", L"Hide EMS script HUD", L"藏改版服 EMS 白字（HudScriptedMode）；不含聊天/投票/原版/SKT", L"Hide server EMS text (HudScriptedMode); excludes chat/votes/stock/SKT", L"自定义 HUD > 隐藏 EMS 脚本 HUD", L"Custom HUD > Hide EMS script HUD", L"", {26, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_8a088766
    {L"队友血条", L"Teammate health bars", L"自己+最多8名队友，也可只显示自己。栏位按玩家槽摆放，头像仍跟本局角色。", L"Yourself and up to 8 teammates, or self only. Panels follow player slots; portraits follow characters.", L"自定义 HUD > 队友血条", L"Custom HUD > Teammate health bars", L"", {15, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_2cdb9a5f
    {L"额外的主武器子弹数HUD", L"Extra primary ammo HUD", L"血条里的弹药还在。这是一套无底框的弹匣/备弹数字，方便挪到准星旁，省得盯屏幕边缘。", L"Borderless clip/reserve numbers near the crosshair; health-bar ammo remains available.", L"自定义 HUD > 额外的主武器子弹数HUD", L"Custom HUD > Extra primary ammo HUD", L"", {21, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_7a00fd89
    {L"额外的药包投掷物 HUD", L"Extra healing / throwable HUD", L"竖排显示自己的投掷物、医疗包/电击器、止痛药/肾上腺素，方便挪到准星附近", L"Vertical throwable, medkit/defibrillator and pills/adrenaline slots near the crosshair", L"自定义 HUD > 额外的药包投掷物 HUD", L"Custom HUD > Extra healing / throwable HUD", L"", {40, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_1cea098d
