    {L"倒地救援", L"Revive", L"独立进度条，显示谁在救、救到百分之几", L"Separate progress bar showing the rescuer and completion percentage", L"自定义 HUD > 倒地救援", L"Custom HUD > Revive", L"", {24, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_8048d5e0
