    {L"导演压力 HUD", L"Director intensity HUD", L"压力柱按玩家槽；阶段名与原版导演 HUD 相同（BUILD_UP / SUSTAIN_PEAK / PEAK_FADE / RELAX）", L"Intensity bars follow player slots; stock phases: BUILD_UP / SUSTAIN_PEAK / PEAK_FADE / RELAX", L"自定义 HUD > 导演压力 HUD", L"Custom HUD > Director intensity HUD", L"", {17, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_db47d48d
    {L"换弹 / 开火后摇环", L"Reload / fire recovery ring", L"紫=换弹进度（闲置换弹也能检测） 青=开火后摇/切枪前摇（喷推/狙推也能检测）。只读取当前武器。", L"Purple: reload (including idle reload); cyan: fire recovery/equip delay (including shotgun/sniper shoves). Current weapon only.", L"自定义 HUD > 换弹 / 开火后摇环", L"Custom HUD > Reload / fire recovery ring", L"", {29, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_9f478cd3
    {L"推击冷却 / 疲劳", L"Shove cooldown / fatigue", L"推击惩罚钻石格 + 冷却灯芯；还可推几下到疲劳", L"Shove penalty diamonds and cooldown indicator; shows shoves left before fatigue", L"自定义 HUD > 推击冷却 / 疲劳", L"Custom HUD > Shove cooldown / fatigue", L"", {28, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_120fd9e5
