    {L"地面危险持续时间", L"Ground hazard duration", L"燃烧瓶、胆汁瓶与 Spitter 酸液的地面剩余时间凭证条", L"Remaining ground duration bars for Molotov fire, bile and Spitter acid", L"自定义 HUD > 地面危险持续时间", L"Custom HUD > Ground hazard duration", L"", {30, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_89a367f4
    {L"关卡名 / 章节进度", L"Map name / chapter progress", L"上方战役名与关卡进度，下方章节名；名称缺失时回退原显示", L"Campaign and chapter progress above, chapter name below; missing names use the original display", L"自定义 HUD > 关卡名 / 章节进度", L"Custom HUD > Map name / chapter progress", L"", {22, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_1f530bec
