    {L"特感连杀 HUD", L"Special infected streak HUD", L"默认 8 秒内连续击杀特感；第 3 杀起弹出约 2 秒并显示当前连杀数", L"Default: SI kills within 8 seconds; from the third kill, show the streak count for about 2 seconds", L"自定义 HUD > 特感连杀 HUD", L"Custom HUD > Special infected streak HUD", L"", {36, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_bbaf86d0
