    {L"归零当前模型全部调整", L"Reset all changes for this model", kMenuDiscoverySummaries[11].text.chinese, L"Adjust weapon-model position, angles, pivot and mirroring per model.", L"更强大的持枪视角调节", L"Advanced viewmodel adjustment", L"", {121, 2, 1}, false, false}, // ViewModelResetAll
    {L"重新读取已保存配置", L"Reload saved profiles", kMenuDiscoverySummaries[11].text.chinese, L"Adjust weapon-model position, angles, pivot and mirroring per model.", L"更强大的持枪视角调节", L"Advanced viewmodel adjustment", L"", {121, 2, 2}, false, false}, // ViewModelReload
    {L"加载实验性选项 / 总开关", L"Experimental loading options / Master switch", L"总开关开启后，仅已开启的分项生效。模型网格和碰撞异步默认开启，模型动画异步默认关闭。加载计时不依赖总开关，默认开启。", L"With the master ON, only enabled options take effect. Mesh and collision async default to ON; animation async defaults to OFF. The loading timer is separate and defaults to ON.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 0, 1}, false, true}, // FastLoadEnabled
    {L"重复路径拆分复用", L"Reuse repeated path splits", L"加载时反复把资源路径拆成目录、文件名和扩展名。只保存最近一次输入及拆分结果，完全相同时复用；不跳过资源加载，不缓存资源或 VPK 内容。历史单次约 1300 万次处理中，约 1299 万次复用，原生拆分约 1.53 万次。重复越多越可能受益，并非固定提速保证。", L"Loading repeatedly splits paths into directory, filename and extension. Keep only the last input and split result; reuse exact matches without skipping resource loads or caching resource/VPK contents. One historical run reused about 12.99 million of 13 million calls, with about 15,300 native splits. More repetition may help; speedup is not guaranteed.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 0, 2}, false, true}, // FastLoadPaths
    {L"跳过连续无关 VPK 包", L"Skip consecutive unrelated VPKs", L"目录摘要、命中/未命中判断和连续跳过作为整体启停：排除不可能包含目标的 VPK，一次越过连续无关包；保留原有查找顺序和原生文件确认，不合包、不缓存文件内容。", L"Directory summaries, hit/miss checks and consecutive skips work as one mechanism. Bypass VPKs that cannot contain the target, preserving mod priority and native file confirmation. No pack merging or file-content cache.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 0, 3}, false, true}, // FastLoadVpk
    {L"模型网格异步加载", L"Async model mesh loading", L"加载时异步读取模型网格，结束前等完已提交任务并恢复原来的设置。依赖总开关，默认开启。", L"Read model meshes asynchronously during loading, finish submitted work and restore the previous setting before play. Requires the master switch. Defaults to ON.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 0, 4}, false, true}, // FastLoadAsyncMesh
    {L"碰撞模型异步加载", L"Async collision model loading", L"加载时异步读取碰撞模型，结束前等完已提交任务并恢复原来的设置。依赖总开关，默认开启。", L"Read collision models asynchronously during loading, finish submitted work and restore the previous setting before play. Requires the master switch. Defaults to ON.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 0, 5}, false, true}, // FastLoadAsyncCollide
    {L"跳过加载时的失焦等待", L"Skip unfocused loading waits", L"仅在加载且游戏失去焦点时跳过引擎休眠；前台加载通常不受益，加载结束或关闭后恢复原有等待。", L"Skip engine sleeps only while loading without focus. Foreground loading usually gains nothing. Restore normal waits when loading ends or this option is disabled.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 0, 6}, false, true}, // FastLoadBackground
    {L"提前显示游戏画面", L"Show game scene early", L"客户端原生准备结束后，在服务器仍等人或冻结队伍时先显示场景；不提前解冻、不缩短服务器等待，不代表更早可以操作。等待期间视角可能尚未就位。适用于远端服的客户端机制，服务器插件及特殊模式仍需实测。", L"After native client preparation, show the scene while the server still waits or freezes the team. Does not unfreeze players, shorten server waits or allow earlier control. The waiting view may not be positioned yet. Client-side mechanism for remote servers; plugins and special modes still need testing.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 0, 7}, false, true}, // FastLoadEarlyView
    {L"取消本地开局固定等待", L"Skip local start countdown", L"仅自己单人或开房有效，影响全房开局：服务器确认可以开局后，取消额外固定 3 秒倒计时。仍等待队友或原生超时，不跳过资源准备；远端服务器无效。", L"Solo or self-hosted rooms only; affects the whole room. Remove the fixed extra 3-second countdown after the server allows play. Keep waiting for teammates or the native timeout; skip no resource preparation. No effect on remote servers.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 0, 8}, false, true}, // FastLoadLocalReady
    {L"实验性选项", L"Experimental options [Settings]", L"有效性和可靠性有待进一步证明的实验性功能，点击进入可开启选择并自行测试。", L"Experimental features whose effectiveness and reliability need further verification. Open this page to select and enable options for your own tests.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta） > 实验性选项", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta) > Experimental options [Settings]", L"", {130, 0, 0}, false, true}, // FastLoadExperimentsEntry
    {L"加载计时", L"Loading timer", L"从加载画面出现到游戏画面出现，聊天框显示英文 [Skeeto] Finished loading in 和秒数。不依赖总开关，默认开启。提前显示游戏画面开启时，计到画面出现为止。 此为程序的测量计时，可能不等同于你可感知的实际加载时间。", L"From the loading screen until the game view appears, chat shows [Skeeto] Finished loading in and the seconds. Independent of the master switch. Defaults to ON. With early view on, it ends when the view appears. This is a program-measured duration and may differ from the loading time you perceive.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 1, 1}, false, true}, // FastLoadChatTime
    {L"输出统计到控制台", L"Print counters to console", L"输出当前已收集统计，不开启任何优化。", L"Print collected counters without enabling any optimization.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 1, 3}, false, true}, // FastLoadReport
    {L"清零统计", L"Reset counters", L"只清零本模块统计，不改变机制开关。", L"Reset only these counters; keep mechanism switches unchanged.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta）", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta)", L"", {124, 1, 4}, false, true}, // FastLoadReset
    {L"模型动画异步加载", L"Async model animation loading", L"加载时异步读取模型动画，结束前等完已提交任务并恢复原来的设置。依赖总开关，默认关闭。", L"Read model animations asynchronously during loading, finish submitted work and restore the previous setting before play. Requires the master switch. Defaults to OFF.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta） > 实验性选项", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta) > Experimental options [Settings]", L"", {130, 0, 1}, false, true}, // FastLoadAsyncAnims
    {L"减少模型强制入缓存", L"Reduce forced model caching", L"仅加载时取消强制把模型数据放入缓存，结束或关闭时还原。", L"Stop forcing model data into cache only during loading; restore on completion or disable.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta） > 实验性选项", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta) > Experimental options [Settings]", L"", {130, 0, 2}, false, true}, // FastLoadLessModelData
    {L"减少模型预热", L"Reduce model warm-up", L"仅加载时取消主动触碰模型数据，结束或关闭时还原。", L"Skip proactive model-data touching only during loading; restore on completion or disable.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta） > 实验性选项", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta) > Experimental options [Settings]", L"", {130, 0, 3}, false, true}, // FastLoadLessTouch
    {L"减少强制预载", L"Reduce forced preloading", L"仅加载时取消客户端强制预载，必需资源仍由引擎决定，结束或关闭时还原。未证明完整净收益；模组或脚本可能改回开启，本功能不会反复强制覆盖。默认关闭。", L"Disable forced client preloading only during loading; required resources remain engine-controlled. Restore on completion or disable. No proven full-interval net gain. Mods/scripts may re-enable it; this option does not repeatedly override them. Defaults to OFF.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta） > 实验性选项", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta) > Experimental options [Settings]", L"", {130, 0, 4}, false, true}, // FastLoadLessPreload
    {L"取消本地过关切图等待(Beta)", L"Skip local chapter transition wait (Beta)", L"仅自己单人或开房有效，影响全房：把过关后、开始切图前原生额外等待 8 秒设为 0，仍由引擎正常调度切图。远端服务器需要专门的插件适配，通常无效。 开启此功能后会造成过关加载背景黑屏，章节统计HUD可以正常显示。", L"Solo or self-hosted rooms only; affects the whole room. Set the native extra 8-second wait after chapter completion, before the map change begins, to 0; the engine still schedules the map change normally. Remote servers need dedicated plugin support and are usually unaffected. Enabling this causes a black background during chapter-transition loading; the chapter stats HUD remains visible.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta） > 实验性选项", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta) > Experimental options [Settings]", L"", {130, 0, 5}, false, true}, // FastLoadLocalTransition
    {L"跳过非当前地图包", L"Skip other map packs", L"加载时跳过可明确识别的非当前地图/战役 VPK，保留当前战役相关分包及纯材质、模型、音效资源包。不修改或卸载模组；按独立战役互不供资源处理。默认关闭。", L"During loading, skip clearly identified VPKs for other maps/campaigns. Keep current-campaign parts and pure material, model and sound packs. No Mod files are changed or unmounted; assumes independent campaigns do not supply each other. Defaults to OFF.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta） > 实验性选项", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta) > Experimental options [Settings]", L"", {130, 0, 6}, false, true}, // FastLoadMapPacks
    {L"更细的文件过滤", L"Finer file filtering", L"对相邻重复资源路径，复用当前挂载代次中原生已确认的文件查找结果，跳过确定不存在的 VPK；不扫描整包建表，不缓存资源内容或打开结果，保留原生顺序和最终确认。首次查询仍有成本，效果请自行对照。两项 VPK 实验自动使用目录候选机制；默认关闭。", L"For adjacent repeated resource paths, reuse native-confirmed file lookup results within the current mount generation and skip absent VPKs. No full-pack index, resource contents or open results are cached; native order and final confirmation remain. First queries still cost work; compare results yourself. Both VPK experiments use directory candidates. Defaults to OFF.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta） > 实验性选项", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta) > Experimental options [Settings]", L"", {130, 0, 7}, false, true}, // FastLoadFileFilter
    {L"减少纹理强制预热", L"Reduce forced texture warm-up", L"仅加载时跳过将托管纹理逐个强制送入显存的预热；纹理读取、创建和正常绘制仍由引擎处理，不改原有变量。可能将部分上传开销推迟到首次看到材质时，进图后可能短暂卡顿。远端可用，效果和可靠性请自行测试；默认关闭。", L"Only during loading, skip forcing managed textures into GPU memory one by one. Native texture reads, creation and normal drawing remain; existing ConVar values are unchanged. Some uploads may move to the first visible use and cause a short hitch after loading. Works on remote servers; test effectiveness and reliability yourself. Defaults to OFF.", L"引擎资源加载提速（Beta） > 实验性选项", L"Engine resource loading acceleration (Beta) > Experimental options [Settings]", L"", {130, 0, 8}, false, true}, // FastLoadLessTextureWarmup
    {L"自定义主菜单UI", L"Custom main menu UI", L"鼠标点击、方向键 / Tab 与 Enter；主菜单设置中可绑定或解绑快捷键。快速创建大厅使用原生战役选图。", L"Experimental: mouse, arrows / Tab, Enter. Shortcuts are customizable in Main menu settings. Quick lobby opens the native campaign selection.", L"自定义游戏UI > 自定义主菜单UI", L"Custom game UI > Custom main menu UI", L"", {103, 0, 0}, false, false}, // GameUiMainEntry
