    {L"会话钉跨启动记忆", L"Remember session pins across launches", L"会话滑块和 skt_cvar 退出游戏再进仍按上次的值钉回。进禁 MOD 服仍会暂停。预设是另外保存的命名快照。", L"Session sliders and skt_cvar keep their last value after you quit and start the game again. A mod-ban server still pauses them. Presets stay separate named snapshots.", L"自定义游戏UI > 自定义ESC菜单UI", L"Custom game UI > Custom ESC menu UI", L"", {128, 0, 9}, false, false}, // EscUiCvarRemember
    {L"清除已记忆的会话钉", L"Clear remembered session pins", L"会话滑块和 skt_cvar 退出游戏再进仍按上次的值钉回。进禁 MOD 服仍会暂停。预设是另外保存的命名快照。", L"Session sliders and skt_cvar keep their last value after you quit and start the game again. A mod-ban server still pauses them. Presets stay separate named snapshots.", L"自定义游戏UI > 自定义ESC菜单UI", L"Custom game UI > Custom ESC menu UI", L"", {128, 1, 1}, false, false}, // EscUiCvarClear
    {L"战役危险描边", L"Campaign danger outlines", L"合作战役与写实模式中存活的本地生还者可用。场上有存活 Tank 时，描边 Tank 可以打的铁，包括警报车、普通车和其他非车模型；没有 Tank 则不显示。Tank 与 Witch 存活时持续描边，惊扰不影响 Witch。范围内持续预警，不受建筑遮挡影响。已有服务器描边保持原样。", L"For a living local survivor in coop campaign or Realism. While a living Tank is present, outline every prop that Tank can punch, including alarm cars, ordinary cars and non-vehicle models. Nothing is outlined when no Tank is present. Living Tanks and Witches stay outlined, including startled Witches. Warnings remain visible within range even behind buildings. Existing server outlines are preserved.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 战役危险描边", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Campaign danger outlines", L"", {125, 0, 0}, false, false}, // CampaignOutlineEntry
    {L"关闭特感布偶/尸体", L"Disable special infected ragdolls/bodies", L"特感/Tank 死亡后不产生任何渐隐的布偶效果，杀怪体验更清爽。Skeeto 的此功能不依赖 -lv 启动项。", L"No fading ragdolls after SI/Tank death — cleaner kills. Works without the -lv launch option.", L"战斗增强与视听优化", L"Combat, audio and visuals", L"", {9, 0, 2}, false, false}, // Text_2e52ac0c
    {L"关闭普感布偶/尸体", L"Disable common infected ragdolls/bodies", L"普感/Witch 死亡后不产生任何渐隐的布偶效果；用 zombie_death 精确处理，与粒子消散互斥。不依赖 -lv。", L"Common/Witch deaths leave no fading ragdolls; uses zombie_death for exact handling, mutually exclusive with dissolve. No -lv required.", L"战斗增强与视听优化", L"Combat, audio and visuals", L"", {9, 0, 3}, false, false}, // Text_cf0f9d87
    {L"描边颜色与渲染", L"Glow colors and rendering [Settings]", L"分别设置八名角色的原版队友描边颜色，并可启用常驻显示", L"Set vanilla teammate glow colors for all eight survivors and enable always-on glow.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 描边颜色与渲染", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Glow colors and rendering [Settings]", L"", {37, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_bc8f7842
    {L"聚光灯夜视", L"Spotlight night vision [Settings]", L"在玩家周围生成柔和动态光源，照亮附近黑暗区域", L"Creates a soft dynamic light around the player to illuminate nearby dark areas.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 聚光灯夜视", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Spotlight night vision [Settings]", L"", {38, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_12c753c0
    {L"强制 Cvar 修改", L"Force Cvar overrides [Settings]", L"仅在子菜单中启用的项目写入对应客户端 Cvar；默认全部关闭。", L"Only enabled submenu items write their client cvars; all are off by default.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 强制 Cvar 修改", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Force Cvar overrides [Settings]", L"", {45, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_5e4f927c
    {L"关闭枪械曳光弹", L"Disable weapon tracers", L"开启此项才关闭原版默认显示的第一人称枪械曳光；关闭选项时恢复原值。", L"Disables vanilla first-person weapon tracers when enabled; restores the original value when disabled.", L"战斗增强与视听优化", L"Combat, audio and visuals", L"", {9, 0, 7}, false, false}, // Text_a48a3e64
    {L"安全屋结算音乐", L"Safe-room completion music [Settings]", L"读取 sound/skeeto/safe/ 内 WAV、MP3，支持松散文件及已挂载 VPK。支持固定或随机播放；随机模式使用全部列表。关闭功能仍可在本页试听。", L"Reads WAV/MP3 in sound/skeeto/safe/ from loose files and mounted VPKs. Fixed or random playback; random uses the whole list. Preview works when disabled.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 安全屋结算音乐", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Safe-room completion music [Settings]", L"", {96, 0, 0}, false, false}, // SafeMusicEntry
    {L"原版人物ID常驻", L"Always show stock survivor IDs", L"保留原版样式，忽略遮挡、距离和准星范围；最多 8 名幸存者，写实不可用。自绘人物ID生效时优先显示自绘版本。", L"Keep stock styling without occlusion, distance or crosshair limits. Up to 8 survivors; unavailable in Realism. Custom name HUD takes priority while active.", L"战斗增强与视听优化", L"Combat, audio and visuals", L"", {9, 0, 9}, false, false}, // NativeWorldNamesRow
    {L"激光红点常驻描边", L"Persistent laser sight outlines", L"只描边原版模型的地上激光红点，2000 游戏单位内隔墙可见。已拾取或装上武器的不描。只有存活的本地生还者能看到。默认关闭。可绑定 skeeto_laser_outline。", L"Outlines stock-model laser sights on the ground through walls within 2000 game units. Picked-up or weapon-mounted sights are not outlined. Only a living local survivor can see them. Default off. Bind skeeto_laser_outline.", L"战斗增强与视听优化", L"Combat, audio and visuals", L"", {9, 1, 1}, false, false}, // LaserSightOutline
    {L"可交互物品扫描", L"Interactable item scan", L"按下绑定键后，短暂描边周围按钮、门、动态模型和部分物理/可破坏道具。可误报。默认关闭。绑定 skeeto_interact_scan。音效与特效跟物资扫描开关一致。", L"After binding a key, briefly outlines nearby buttons, doors, dynamic props and some physics/breakable props. False positives are expected. Default off. Bind skeeto_interact_scan. Sound and effect follow the Supply Scan toggles.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 可交互物品扫描", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Interactable item scan", L"", {145, 0, 0}, false, false}, // InteractScanEntry
    {L"枪声听感增强，即Gunshot Feel", L"Gunshot feel", L"保留原版开火声，再叠一层明显变调的额外枪声。冲击更高，低频更沉，短尾会再跟一声，亮瞬态更尖。与「优化听声辨位」互斥。", L"Keeps the original gunshot and adds a clearly pitched extra shot. Punch is higher, Low is deeper, Short tail adds a second hit, and Bright is sharper. Turns off spatial-audio lock.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 枪声听感增强，即Gunshot Feel", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Gunshot feel", L"", {127, 0, 0}, false, false}, // ScriptGunFeelEntry
    {L"Tank 可交互铁描边", L"Tank hittable outlines", L"合作战役与写实模式中存活的本地生还者可用。场上有存活 Tank 时，描边 Tank 可以打的铁，包括警报车、普通车和其他非车模型；没有 Tank 则不显示。Tank 与 Witch 存活时持续描边，惊扰不影响 Witch。范围内持续预警，不受建筑遮挡影响。已有服务器描边保持原样。", L"For a living local survivor in coop campaign or Realism. While a living Tank is present, outline every prop that Tank can punch, including alarm cars, ordinary cars and non-vehicle models. Nothing is outlined when no Tank is present. Living Tanks and Witches stay outlined, including startled Witches. Warnings remain visible within range even behind buildings. Existing server outlines are preserved.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 战役危险描边", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Campaign danger outlines", L"", {125, 0, 1}, false, false}, // CampaignOutlineCar
