    {L"队友惊扰女巫警示图标", L"Teammate Witch startle warning icon", L"队友首次惊扰女巫时，在其头顶显示约 5 秒三角爪痕警示；自己惊扰不显示", L"First teammate Witch startle: overhead triangular claw warning for about 5 seconds; excludes your own startles", L"世界 HUD", L"World HUD", L"", {35, 1, 9}, false, false}, // Text_b7ee4fe2
    {L"队友黑白状态提示", L"Teammate black-and-white indicator", L"队友进入黑白状态（二倒被救起）时，在其血条旁常驻显示裂心心电图标记，恢复后消失", L"Black-and-white teammates (revived after two incaps) get a broken-heart ECG beside their health bar until recovered", L"世界 HUD", L"World HUD", L"", {35, 2, 1}, false, false}, // Text_20ebe881
    {L"无条件显示人物ID", L"Always show survivor names", L"常驻显示其他幸存者名字，忽略遮挡、距离和准星范围；写实模式禁用", L"Show other survivors through obstacles, regardless of distance or crosshair; unavailable in Realism", L"世界 HUD > 无条件显示人物ID", L"World HUD > Always show survivor names", L"", {102, 0, 0}, false, false}, // TeamWorldNames
    {L"队友黑枪警示", L"Teammate friendly-fire warning", L"队友黑枪打中自己时，在攻击者头顶显示原有红色警示图标约 2 秒。", L"When a teammate damages you, the existing red warning appears above the attacker for about 2 seconds.", L"世界 HUD", L"World HUD", L"", {35, 2, 3}, false, false}, // WorldFriendlyFireOption
    {L"队友黑枪伤害数字", L"Teammate FF damage numbers", L"自己误伤队友时，在队友头顶显示放大的黄色/红色伤害数字；15 点及以上为重度。默认关。", L"When you hit a teammate, show a large yellow/red damage number above them. 15 damage or more is heavy. Default off.", L"世界 HUD", L"World HUD", L"", {35, 2, 4}, false, false}, // WorldFriendlyFireDamageNum
