    {L"半自动武器按住连发，即Automatic Guns", L"Hold-to-fire for semi-auto weapons, i.e. Automatic Guns", L"只对「按一次打一发」的枪生效；打包、灌油等长按操作与全自动武器完全不受影响。", L"Only guns that fire once per press; hold actions such as using a medkit or fuelling a generator, and full-auto weapons, are completely unaffected.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 半自动武器按住连发，即Automatic Guns", L"Skeetoscript > Hold-to-fire for semi-auto weapons, i.e. Automatic Guns", L"", {67, 0, 0}, false, false}, // TextHoldSemiFire
    {L"霰弹枪自动换弹，即Shotgun Auto Reload", L"Shotgun Auto Reload", L"手持霰弹枪时按 200-300ms 随机间隔合成换弹键边沿；弹匣满时按键被忽略，无副作用", L"With a shotgun in hand, synthesizes a reload key edge every 200-300 ms at random intervals; the key is ignored while the magazine is full", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 霰弹枪自动换弹，即Shotgun Auto Reload", L"Skeetoscript > Shotgun Auto Reload", L"", {68, 0, 0}, false, false}, // TextShotgunReload
    {L"视角倾斜，即Black Mesa View Tilt", L"Black Mesa View Tilt [Settings]", L"左右移动时视角轻微倾斜（sv_rollangle / sv_rollspeed；对应工坊 Black Mesa View Tilt）", L"Slight view tilt while strafing (sv_rollangle / sv_rollspeed; Workshop: Black Mesa View Tilt).", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 视角倾斜，即Black Mesa View Tilt", L"Skeetoscript > Black Mesa View Tilt [Settings]", L"", {139, 0, 0}, false, false}, // Text_efbf530a
    {L"感染者尸体粒子消散，即Dissolve Infected", L"Infected corpse particle dissolve, Dissolve Infected", L"引擎内置类型。电气 / 电气(轻) 会刷火花粒子；普通偏淡出；核心较少见。按 3 循环。", L"Engine built-in types. Electrical / Electrical Light spawn spark particles; Normal is mostly fade; Core is rarer. Press 3 to cycle.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 感染者尸体粒子消散，即Dissolve Infected", L"Skeetoscript > Infected corpse particle dissolve, Dissolve Infected", L"", {71, 0, 0}, false, false}, // DissolveEntry
    {L"口水酸液范围估算轮廓，即Spitter Acid Range Outline", L"Spitter acid range estimate outline, Spitter Acid Range Outline", L"纯客户端：按 insect_swarm 火焰节点估算地面范围（不改伤害）。与「酸液残留」倒计时独立。", L"Client-only: estimate ground range from insect_swarm fire nodes (does not change damage). Separate from acid residue countdown.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 口水酸液范围估算轮廓，即Spitter Acid Range Outline", L"Skeetoscript > Spitter acid range estimate outline, Spitter Acid Range Outline", L"", {77, 0, 0}, false, false}, // AcidOutlineEntry
    {L"砍舌提示 HUD，即Tongue Cut Trainer", L"Tongue Cut Trainer HUD, Tongue Cut Trainer", L"打开本页时循环预览「准备 → 砍！/躲！ → 结果」。文字随手持武器自动切换。", L"A looping preview (ready > CUT!/DODGE! > result) shows while this page is open. Text follows the weapon in hand.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 砍舌提示 HUD，即Tongue Cut Trainer", L"Skeetoscript > Tongue Cut Trainer HUD, Tongue Cut Trainer", L"", {79, 0, 0}, false, false}, // TongueCutEntry
    {L"检测到场上只剩一人自动播放雨爱", L"Auto-play Rainie Love when only one survivor remains [Settings]", L"音轨：sound\\skeeto\\the last man\\Rainie_Love.mp3，支持 GAME / VPK。", L"Track: sound\\skeeto\\the last man\\Rainie_Love.mp3. GAME / VPK supported.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 检测到场上只剩一人自动播放雨爱", L"Skeetoscript > Auto-play Rainie Love when only one survivor remains [Settings]", L"", {104, 0, 0}, false, false}, // LastMusicEntry
    {L"第三人称弹道修正，即Third Person Aim Fix", L"Third Person Aim Fix [Settings]", L"此功能与“静默自瞄”的核心技术手段高度类似，是修正弹道而不是修正准星，可以实现第三人称居中准星。实验性娱乐功能，虽然可选择开启AAC模块，但仍建议优先使用准星设置模块的准星修正功能而不是此弹道修正功能。", L"This feature uses core techniques highly similar to silent aim. It changes shot direction rather than the crosshair to enable a centered third-person crosshair. Experimental entertainment feature: even with optional AAC enabled, prefer the crosshair correction in Crosshair settings over this shot-direction correction.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 第三人称弹道修正，即Third Person Aim Fix", L"Skeetoscript > Third Person Aim Fix [Settings]", L"", {115, 0, 0}, false, false}, // TpsAimEntry
    {L"战役完成度显示，即Campaign Completion Display", L"Campaign Completion Display [Settings]", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript)", L"Skeetoscript", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 战役完成度显示，即Campaign Completion Display", L"Skeetoscript > Campaign Completion Display [Settings]", L"", {78, 0, 0}, false, false}, // ProgressMenuName
    {L"隐藏角色挂载模型，即Hide items on the back", L"Hide items on the back [Settings]", L"总开关关闭时保留原版显示。分类项开启表示隐藏该类挂载模型；手持和地面模型仍保留。", L"Master off keeps the original display. An enabled category hides its attached models; held and ground models stay visible.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 隐藏角色挂载模型，即Hide items on the back", L"Skeetoscript > Hide items on the back [Settings]", L"", {122, 0, 0}, false, false}, // HideBackItems
    {L"倒地视角倾斜，即Accurate View Roll on Incap", L"Incapacitated view roll", kMenuDiscoverySummaries[6].text.chinese, L"Provide selected notices, sounds and gameplay aids on the client.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript)", L"Skeetoscript", L"", {31, 1, 8}, false, false}, // ScriptIncapRoll
