    {L"枪声房间混响，即Dynamic Gun Reverb", L"Dynamic gun reverb", kMenuDiscoverySummaries[6].text.chinese, L"Provide selected notices, sounds and gameplay aids on the client.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript)", L"Skeetoscript", L"", {31, 2, 3}, false, false}, // ScriptGunReverb
    {L"弹反短闪，即PARRY", L"Parry flash, PARRY", L"成功时短闪白屏（白光开关默认开，时长默认0.2秒，可关闭并在0.1到0.6秒间调节），并播放 sound\\skeeto\\parry\\ 中的一首音效。可固定选择，也可随机播放。支持松散文件和已挂载 VPK，格式为 WAV、MP3。自己开的本地服会把游戏速度降到一成，约 0.6 秒后恢复，大厅本地联机里的其他玩家也会一起变慢；进别人的服务器不改变游戏速度。总开关默认关闭。", L"White flash and one cue from sound\\skeeto\\parry\\. The flash defaults on and its duration defaults to 0.2 seconds; set it from 0.1 to 0.6 seconds or turn it off. Choose one cue file or play at random. Loose files and mounted VPKs, WAV or MP3. On a listen server the game drops to one tenth speed for about 0.6 seconds, including lobby local games; another server does not change game speed. Master defaults off.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 弹反短闪，即PARRY", L"Skeetoscript > Parry flash, PARRY", L"", {126, 0, 0}, false, false}, // ScriptParryEntry
    {L"物资扫描，即Survivor Sense", L"Supply scan, Survivor Sense", L"开启后，按下绑定按键才会扫描。控制台绑定：bind <按键> skeeto_supply_scan。", L"When this is on, the bound key starts a scan. Console bind: bind <key> skeeto_supply_scan.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 物资扫描，即Survivor Sense", L"Skeetoscript > Supply scan, Survivor Sense", L"", {140, 0, 0}, false, false}, // SupplyScanEntry
    {L"警报车武装描边，即Alarm Car Glow", L"Armed alarm-car outline, Alarm Car Glow", L"只提示仍可触发的警报车；不改触发距离。默认关。", L"Outlines alarm cars that can still trigger; does not change trigger range. Default off.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 警报车武装描边，即Alarm Car Glow", L"Skeetoscript > Armed alarm-car outline, Alarm Car Glow", L"", {147, 0, 0}, false, false}, // AlarmCarGlowEntry
    {L"客户端性能预设，即Client Perf Presets", L"Client performance presets, Client Perf Presets", L"按组写入 ConVar；关闭还原本组。不含加载提速已管的 mod_load_*。收益因机而异，默认关。", L"Writes ConVars per group; turning a group off restores that group's snapshot. Does not touch fast-load mod_load_*. Gains vary by machine; default off.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 客户端性能预设，即Client Perf Presets", L"Skeetoscript > Client performance presets, Client Perf Presets", L"", {148, 0, 0}, false, false}, // ClientPerfEntry
