    {L"弹反短闪，即PARRY", L"Parry flash, PARRY", L"成功时短闪白屏（白光开关默认开，时长默认0.2秒，可关闭并在0.1到0.6秒间调节），并播放 sound\\skeeto\\parry\\ 中的一首音效。可固定选择，也可随机播放。支持松散文件和已挂载 VPK，格式为 WAV、MP3。自己开的本地服会把游戏速度降到一成，约 0.6 秒后恢复，大厅本地联机里的其他玩家也会一起变慢；进别人的服务器不改变游戏速度。总开关默认关闭。", L"White flash and one cue from sound\\skeeto\\parry\\. The flash defaults on and its duration defaults to 0.2 seconds; set it from 0.1 to 0.6 seconds or turn it off. Choose one cue file or play at random. Loose files and mounted VPKs, WAV or MP3. On a listen server the game drops to one tenth speed for about 0.6 seconds, including lobby local games; another server does not change game speed. Master defaults off.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 弹反短闪，即PARRY", L"Skeetoscript > Parry flash, PARRY", L"", {126, 0, 1}, false, false}, // ScriptParryMaster
