    {L"第三人称弹道修正", L"Third-person aim correction", L"此功能与“静默自瞄”的核心技术手段高度类似，是修正弹道而不是修正准星，可以实现第三人称居中准星。实验性娱乐功能，虽然可选择开启AAC模块，但仍建议优先使用准星设置模块的准星修正功能而不是此弹道修正功能。", L"This feature uses core techniques highly similar to silent aim. It changes shot direction rather than the crosshair to enable a centered third-person crosshair. Experimental entertainment feature: even with optional AAC enabled, prefer the crosshair correction in Crosshair settings over this shot-direction correction.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 第三人称弹道修正，即Third Person Aim Fix", L"Skeetoscript > Third Person Aim Fix [Settings]", L"", {115, 0, 1}, false, false}, // TpsAimToggle
    {L"Anti-Anti-Cheat轻量反作弊对抗", L"Anti-Anti-Cheat lightweight countermeasures", L"此功能与“静默自瞄”的核心技术手段高度类似，是修正弹道而不是修正准星，可以实现第三人称居中准星。实验性娱乐功能，虽然可选择开启AAC模块，但仍建议优先使用准星设置模块的准星修正功能而不是此弹道修正功能。", L"This feature uses core techniques highly similar to silent aim. It changes shot direction rather than the crosshair to enable a centered third-person crosshair. Experimental entertainment feature: even with optional AAC enabled, prefer the crosshair correction in Crosshair settings over this shot-direction correction.", L"Vscript功能客户端化(Skeetoscript) > 第三人称弹道修正，即Third Person Aim Fix", L"Skeetoscript > Third Person Aim Fix [Settings]", L"", {115, 0, 2}, false, false}, // TpsAimAacToggle
    {L"枪声听感增强", L"Gunshot feel", L"保留原版开火声，再叠一层明显变调的额外枪声。冲击更高，低频更沉，短尾会再跟一声，亮瞬态更尖。四种处理对所有枪相同。与「优化听声辨位」互斥，可与枪声房间混响同时开。默认关闭。", L"Keeps the original gunshot and adds a clearly pitched extra shot. Punch is higher, Low is deeper, Short tail adds a second hit, and Bright is sharper. One treatment for every gun. Turns off spatial-audio lock. Can stay on with gun reverb. Defaults off.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 枪声听感增强，即Gunshot Feel", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Gunshot feel", L"", {127, 0, 1}, false, false}, // ScriptGunFeelMaster
    {L"处理方法", L"Treatment", L"保留原版开火声，再叠一层明显变调的额外枪声。冲击更高，低频更沉，短尾会再跟一声，亮瞬态更尖。四种处理对所有枪相同。与「优化听声辨位」互斥，可与枪声房间混响同时开。默认关闭。", L"Keeps the original gunshot and adds a clearly pitched extra shot. Punch is higher, Low is deeper, Short tail adds a second hit, and Bright is sharper. One treatment for every gun. Turns off spatial-audio lock. Can stay on with gun reverb. Defaults off.", L"战斗增强与视听优化 > 枪声听感增强，即Gunshot Feel", L"Combat, audio and visuals > Gunshot feel", L"", {127, 0, 2}, false, false}, // ScriptGunFeelPreset
